        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek BTB-86621, Riviera Back-to-Back Door Handle Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Riviera Back-to-Back Handle Pair is packaged as a complete set of 2 back to back mounted door pulls. Choose from a 12 inch center to center Riviera Door Pull Pair or an 18 inch center to center Rivera Door Pull Pair. The Riviera Door Pull Set is available in a few popular finish color options including sliver and gold. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. Packaged with 2 door pulls (1 door pull for each side of a door).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available as a single <a href=\"/products/riviera-door-pull-emtek-86621\"><b> Riviera Pull </b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Back-to-Back Riviera Door Handle Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-BTB-86621:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-BTB-86622:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back-to-Back mounting.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
